{
 "info": {
  "name": "Decidiq Mandate Remuneration Read Contract Suite",
  "description": "Newman contract tests for change bodies-director-remuneration task 1 (REQ-DRM-001). A remuneration record is read by the secretariat and administrators in full; an ordinary member does not read it; the public group reads it only when disclosed and its publicationDate has passed. Three callers: the secretariat probe user, a member probe user and an anonymous caller. Written, not yet run: it needs a live instance (run with tests/integration/run-newman.sh and decidiq-environment.json). positionHold carries the nil UUID: the read rule does not depend on it, and building a membership and position type only to satisfy the reference would test something else.",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
 },
 "item": [
  {
   "name": "0. Setup",
